{#
  Site-wide toolbox band — currently PARKED (not included anywhere). The tool
  lineup still needs to be organized before this ships; re-hook it in footer.njk
  ({% include "partials/toolbox.njk" %} above the site-footer) and restore the
  components/toolbox.css import in public/css/app.css when it's ready.

  The tool icons are small bespoke inline SVGs (not the post sprite), so they live
  here as `iconSvgBody` strings rather than in JSON — the `tool` macro drops them
  inside a standard 24×24 stroke wrapper. Tool hrefs are placeholders until the
  real tools land.
#}
